1
00:00:00,730 --> 00:00:04,360
(Leonard:)I figured it would go for thousands,
and I just wanted to be a part of it.

2
00:00:04,525 --> 00:00:07,655
- There's only 30 seconds left in the auction.
- Do you have $800?

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:11,030
- Not to blow on a miniature time machine.
- Don't worry.

4
00:00:11,199 --> 00:00:14,579
People wait until the last second,
then they get it. It's called sniping.

5
00:00:14,744 --> 00:00:18,374
- Fifteen seconds.
- Come on, snipers.

6
00:00:19,082 --> 00:00:22,712
- Ten, nine, eight...
- Where are your snipers?

7
00:00:23,377 --> 00:00:24,507
- Five.
- Snipe.

8
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:25,670
(Howard:)- Four.
- Snipe.

9
00:00:25,838 --> 00:00:27,878
- Three, two.
- Snipe, snipe.

10
00:00:28,049 --> 00:00:29,259
(Raj:)- One.
- Ah!

11
00:00:29,675 --> 00:00:35,135
Oh. Congratulations, you are the proud
owner of a miniature time machine.

12
00:00:35,306 --> 00:00:36,936
- You lucky duck.
LEONARD: Heh.

13
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,560
I wonder why no one else bid.

14
00:00:38,726 --> 00:00:41,186
(Sheldon:)This is a classic piece
of sci-fi movie memorabilia.

15
00:00:41,354 --> 00:00:43,434
I know. But I still can't afford it.

16
00:00:43,606 --> 00:00:46,146
(Howard:)Why don't we share it?
We'll each put in 200 bucks...

17
00:00:46,317 --> 00:00:49,987
- ...and take turns having it in our house.
- A time-share time machine.

18
00:00:51,322 --> 00:00:54,412
(Raj:)- I'm in. Sheldon?
- Wha...? Need you ask?

19
00:00:54,575 --> 00:00:56,865
(Sheldon:)But I still don't understand
why no one else bid.

20
00:01:06,170 --> 00:01:09,020
I understand why no one else bid.

